reader. The vast majority of the source code in this repository was
written by the upstream projects listed below and is used under the
Apache License 2.0. This fork renames, re-themes, and repackages their
work; it claims no ownership of the upstream code.

Upstream projects (their copyright belongs to their respective authors):

  * Tadami — https://github.com/andarcanum/Tadami-Aniyomi-fork
      by andarcanum, a fork of Aniyomi that merges the Mihon/Tachiyomi
      manga, anime, and novel ecosystems.
  * Aniyomi — https://github.com/aniyomiorg/aniyomi
  * Mihon — https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon
  * Tachiyomi — https://github.com/tachiyomiorg/tachiyomi

